* append_400000 -- grows one string a character at a time, 400000 times, and prints its length.
* The witness of row snobol4-under-the-linked-parser-an-append-costs-what-it-costs-under-the-c-parser
* (the cto 2026-11-14): the run's instruction count under SCRIP_PARSE_STAGE=sc less the count under
* SCRIP_PARSE_STAGE=c is the parser module's fixed cost alone, never a cost per append.
        I = 0
        S =
LOOP    S = S 'x'
        I = I + 1
        LT(I,400000)                         :S(LOOP)
        OUTPUT = SIZE(S)
END
